{%- comment -%}
  Mirrors ../design-system/src/react/Card/Card.tsx: a bordered/shadowed content shell that composes
  freely with whatever's nested inside it (CardTitle, CardDescription, CardMedia in React; here,
  any child theme block -- Mionas: Text, image, Mionas: Button, etc.).

  This is a different thing from two other files that already exist:
  - blocks/_card.liquid (native, "Card" in the picker) is a generic LAYOUT panel -- background
    image/video, flexible flex-direction content slot -- styled with Horizon's own generic layout
    tokens (--border-radius, --layer-flat, ...), never design-system --card-* tokens. Untouched here.
  - blocks/mionas-review-card.liquid forks Card's look for one fixed, review-specific composition
    (rating + quote + attribution). This block is the general-purpose shell Card.tsx actually is --
    free children, no fixed content -- which review-card intentionally doesn't expose.

  ## Why this renders through snippets/group.liquid

  The card takes the native Group block's customization surface -- layout direction, alignment, gap,
  size, block link, padding -- by copying those parts of group's schema and delegating rendering to
  snippets/group.liquid, exactly as blocks/_mionas-google-reviews-summary.liquid and
  blocks/_product-list-content.liquid do.

  Deliberately NOT copied: group's Appearance and Borders sections. The card's surface -- background,
  border, radius, shadow -- is what makes it a Card rather than a group, and it is owned entirely by
  the `variant` setting below (Default / Outline / Plain). A merchant who wants an arbitrary
  background colour or border on a free-form container should reach for a Group; a Mionas: Card is
  the design-system surface, sized and laid out however they need. Card.module.css's 320px
  `max-width` cap is dropped for the same reason: the Size settings are now the single answer to how
  wide a card is, and a hidden cap silently contradicting a merchant's Width choice is worse than
  losing that bit of Card.tsx fidelity.

  Surface properties still can't be plain CSS on .mionas-card, though: snippets/group.liquid
  hardcodes `border-style` into its class list and snippets/border-override.liquid emits
  unconditionally, so `.border-style { border-width: var(--border-width); ... }` would fight
  `.mionas-card { border: ... }` at equal specificity -- and block {% raw %}{% stylesheet %}{% endraw %} CSS is bundled
  separately from assets/base.css, so source order isn't something this theme can guarantee.

  The `style:` param is the deterministic way out: the snippet appends it LAST inside the style
  attribute, after border-override, so the `card_style` capture below always wins. It feeds the
  border/radius custom properties that `.border-style` reads, rather than declaring `border` itself.

  Padding behaves exactly as the group's does, defaulting to 0 on every side. This is a conscious
  divergence from Card.tsx, whose .root always carries a bottom padding -- a card here starts with
  no padding at all and the merchant adds what the composition needs. Children therefore bleed to
  all four edges by default, which is still what CardMedia expects on the top and sides.

  Card.tsx is a discriminated union (`as="div"|"a"|"button"`); this only covers div/a (no "as
  button" -- same scope decision mionas-button.liquid and mionas-link.liquid made) via the `link`
  setting. Group renders that as an absolutely-positioned overlay anchor rather than by wrapping the
  card in an <a>, which is the same clickable-whole-surface result and keeps nested links usable.

  snippets/group.liquid also renders background-media and contrast-override, but both are no-ops
  when their settings are absent, so omitting the Appearance schema costs nothing at render time.

  Every colour/radius/shadow/spacing/family here is a --card-* token (assets/design-tokens.css),
  matching Card.module.css. --card-base-font-family resolves through --font-family-archivo, which
  snippets/design-system-bridge.liquid repoints at the theme's loaded body font.
{%- endcomment -%}
{% liquid
  assign block_settings = block.settings
  assign variant = block_settings.variant | default: 'default'

  assign card_classes = 'mionas-card'
  unless variant == 'default'
    assign card_classes = card_classes | append: ' mionas-card--' | append: variant
  endunless
  if block_settings.link != blank
    assign card_classes = card_classes | append: ' mionas-card--interactive'
  endif
%}

{%- comment -%}
  The whole card surface, driven by `variant` alone. Plain is a transparent, square, borderless
  surface -- it contributes no background so whatever sits behind the card shows through.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- capture card_style -%}
  {%- case variant -%}
    {%- when 'plain' -%}
      --border-width: 0; --border-style: none; --border-radius: 0;
    {%- when 'outline' -%}
      background: var(--card-base-background);
      --border-width: var(--card-base-border-width); --border-style: solid;
      --border-color: var(--card-outline-border-color); --border-radius: var(--card-base-radius);
    {%- else -%}
      background: var(--card-base-background);
      --border-width: var(--card-base-border-width); --border-style: solid;
      --border-color: var(--card-base-border-color); --border-radius: var(--card-base-radius);
  {%- endcase -%}
{%- endcapture -%}

{%- capture children -%}
  {%- content_for 'blocks' -%}
{%- endcapture -%}

{%- render 'group',
  children: children,
  settings: block_settings,
  shopify_attributes: block.shopify_attributes,
  block_id: block.id,
  class: card_classes,
  style: card_style
-%}

{% stylesheet %}
  /* Background, border and radius are NOT declared here -- they ride on the `style:` param above,
     which is the only way to beat .border-style deterministically. See the file comment. Padding is
     absent entirely: it comes from the Padding settings alone, which start at 0. */
  .mionas-card {
    box-shadow: var(--card-base-shadow);
    font-family: var(--card-base-font-family);
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .mionas-card--outline,
  .mionas-card--plain {
    box-shadow: none;
  }

  .mionas-card--interactive {
    cursor: pointer;
  }

  .mionas-card--interactive:active {
    opacity: var(--card-state-pressed-opacity);
  }
{% endstylesheet %}

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Mionas: Card",
  "tag": null,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "@theme"
    },
    {
      "type": "@app"
    },
    {
      "type": "_divider"
    }
  ],
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "select",
      "id": "variant",
      "label": "Variant",
      "options": [
        { "value": "default", "label": "Default" },
        { "value": "outline", "label": "Outline" },
        { "value": "plain", "label": "Plain" }
      ],
      "default": "default"
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "t:content.layout"
    },
    {
      "type": "select",
      "id": "content_direction",
      "label": "t:settings.direction",
      "options": [
        {
          "value": "column",
          "label": "t:options.vertical"
        },
        {
          "value": "row",
          "label": "t:options.horizontal"
        }
      ],
      "default": "column"
    },
    {
      "type": "checkbox",
      "id": "vertical_on_mobile",
      "label": "t:settings.vertical_on_mobile",
      "default": true,
      "visible_if": "{{ block.settings.content_direction == 'row' }}"
    },
    {
      "type": "select",
      "id": "horizontal_alignment",
      "label": "t:settings.alignment",
      "options": [
        {
          "value": "flex-start",
          "label": "t:options.left"
        },
        {
          "value": "center",
          "label": "t:options.center"
        },
        {
          "value": "flex-end",
          "label": "t:options.right"
        },
        {
          "value": "space-between",
          "label": "t:options.space_between"
        }
      ],
      "default": "flex-start",
      "visible_if": "{{ block.settings.content_direction == 'row' }}"
    },
    {
      "type": "select",
      "id": "vertical_alignment",
      "label": "t:settings.position",
      "options": [
        {
          "value": "flex-start",
          "label": "t:options.top"
        },
        {
          "value": "center",
          "label": "t:options.center"
        },
        {
          "value": "flex-end",
          "label": "t:options.bottom"
        }
      ],
      "default": "center",
      "visible_if": "{{ block.settings.content_direction == 'row' }}"
    },
    {
      "type": "checkbox",
      "id": "align_baseline",
      "label": "t:settings.align_baseline",
      "default": false,
      "visible_if": "{{ block.settings.vertical_alignment == 'flex-end' }}"
    },
    {
      "type": "select",
      "id": "horizontal_alignment_flex_direction_column",
      "label": "t:settings.alignment",
      "options": [
        {
          "value": "flex-start",
          "label": "t:options.left"
        },
        {
          "value": "center",
          "label": "t:options.center"
        },
        {
          "value": "flex-end",
          "label": "t:options.right"
        }
      ],
      "default": "flex-start",
      "visible_if": "{{ block.settings.content_direction != 'row' }}"
    },
    {
      "type": "select",
      "id": "vertical_alignment_flex_direction_column",
      "label": "t:settings.position",
      "options": [
        {
          "value": "flex-start",
          "label": "t:options.top"
        },
        {
          "value": "center",
          "label": "t:options.center"
        },
        {
          "value": "flex-end",
          "label": "t:options.bottom"
        },
        {
          "value": "space-between",
          "label": "t:options.space_between"
        }
      ],
      "default": "center",
      "visible_if": "{{ block.settings.content_direction == 'column' }}"
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "gap",
      "label": "t:settings.gap",
      "min": 0,
      "max": 100,
      "step": 1,
      "unit": "px",
      "default": 0,
      "info": "0 matches the design system: children stack flush, the way CardMedia sits against the text under it."
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "t:content.size"
    },
    {
      "type": "select",
      "id": "width",
      "label": "t:settings.width",
      "options": [
        {
          "value": "fit-content",
          "label": "t:options.fit_content"
        },
        {
          "value": "fill",
          "label": "t:options.fill"
        },
        {
          "value": "custom",
          "label": "t:options.custom"
        }
      ],
      "default": "fill"
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "custom_width",
      "label": "t:settings.custom_width",
      "min": 0,
      "max": 100,
      "step": 1,
      "unit": "%",
      "default": 100,
      "visible_if": "{{ block.settings.width == 'custom' }}"
    },
    {
      "type": "select",
      "id": "width_mobile",
      "label": "t:settings.width_mobile",
      "options": [
        {
          "value": "fit-content",
          "label": "t:options.fit_content"
        },
        {
          "value": "fill",
          "label": "t:options.fill"
        },
        {
          "value": "custom",
          "label": "t:options.custom"
        }
      ],
      "default": "fill"
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "custom_width_mobile",
      "label": "t:settings.custom_width",
      "min": 0,
      "max": 100,
      "step": 1,
      "unit": "%",
      "default": 100,
      "visible_if": "{{ block.settings.width_mobile == 'custom' }}"
    },
    {
      "type": "select",
      "id": "height",
      "label": "t:settings.height",
      "options": [
        {
          "value": "fit",
          "label": "t:options.fit_content"
        },
        {
          "value": "fill",
          "label": "t:options.fill"
        },
        {
          "value": "custom",
          "label": "t:options.custom"
        }
      ],
      "default": "fit"
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "custom_height",
      "label": "t:settings.custom_height",
      "min": 0,
      "max": 100,
      "step": 1,
      "unit": "%",
      "default": 100,
      "visible_if": "{{ block.settings.height == 'custom' }}"
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "t:content.block_link"
    },
    {
      "type": "url",
      "id": "link",
      "label": "t:settings.link"
    },
    {
      "type": "checkbox",
      "id": "open_in_new_tab",
      "label": "t:settings.open_new_tab",
      "default": false
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "t:content.padding"
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "padding-block-start",
      "label": "t:settings.top",
      "min": 0,
      "max": 100,
      "step": 1,
      "unit": "px",
      "default": 0
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "padding-block-end",
      "label": "t:settings.bottom",
      "min": 0,
      "max": 100,
      "step": 1,
      "unit": "px",
      "default": 0
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "padding-inline-start",
      "label": "t:settings.left",
      "min": 0,
      "max": 100,
      "step": 1,
      "unit": "px",
      "default": 0
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "padding-inline-end",
      "label": "t:settings.right",
      "min": 0,
      "max": 100,
      "step": 1,
      "unit": "px",
      "default": 0
    }
  ],
  "presets": [
    {
      "name": "Mionas: Card",
      "category": "t:categories.layout",
      "settings": {
        "variant": "default",
        "gap": 0
      }
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
